    "body": "Two identical declarations of `NodeId` make it ambiguous for static tools such as IWYU which header should provide the symbol. The first commit moves the declaration into a header of its own.\n\nThe second commit fixes the `#include`s of the `net` and `node/eviction` modules, which the first commit touched, and adds the headers that other files previously received transitively from them.\n\nA prerequisite for https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36808.",
